: "1771fafa164a555f", "version_id": 1069, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "癒やし系シミュレーション『緑意新生』12月7日にSteamで配信開始", "title_zh": "治愈系模拟游戏《绿意新生》12月7日在Steam上线", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 279, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Gamirror Gamesは、Positive Impact Gamesが開発した癒やし系の植物育成シミュレーションゲーム『緑意新生』を12月7日にSteamで配信すると発表した。荒れた土地を緑に戻す、穏やかな体験が特徴である。", "lead_zh": "Gamirror Games宣布，由Positive Impact Games开发的治愈系植物培育模拟游戏《绿意新生》将于12月7日在Steam上线。其特色是让荒芜的土地重归绿色的温和体验。", "preview": "本作は、植物を植え、古い精霊と交流しながら、荒れ地に命をよみがえらせる物語である。プレイヤーは両手と真心、そして少しの魔法で世界を修復し、自分だけの楽園をつくっていく。", "preview_zh": "本作是一款通过种植植物、与古老精灵交流，让荒芜之地重焕生机的故事。玩家用双手与真心，再加上一点魔法修复世界，打造属于自己的乐园。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1052, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 54.025, "size_bytes": 323568, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 187, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@4813f138/content/data/versions/1069.json"}, {"content_hash": "ec81970d378bc317", "version_id": 1070, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "ja_n1", "lang": "ja", "level": 5, "level_label": "N1 上級", "title": "癒やし系シミュレーション『緑意新生』12月7日Steamで発売へ", "title_zh": "治愈系模拟游戏《绿意新生》将于12月7日在Steam发售", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 291, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Gamirror Gamesは、Positive Impact Games開発の癒やし系植栽シミュレーション『緑意新生』を12月7日にSteamで配信すると発表した。荒廃した土地を再生する穏やかな体験が特徴だ。", "lead_zh": "Gamirror Games宣布，将於12月7日在Steam上发行由Positive Impact Games开发的治愈系种植模拟游戏《绿意新生》。其特色是让荒芜土地重获新生的宁静体验。", "preview": "本作は植物を植え、古の精霊と交流しながら荒地を楽園へと蘇らせるシミュレーションである。自らの手と真心、僅かな魔法で世界を修復し、種が大木へ、砂漠がオアシスへと変わる過程を見届ける。", "preview_zh": "本作是一款种植植物、与古老精灵交流、让荒地重获乐园的模拟游戏。玩家用自己的双手、真心与些许魔法修复世界，见证种子长成大树、沙漠化作绿洲的过程。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1053, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/ja_n1.mp3", "duration": 60.55, "size_bytes": 362736, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 192, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@4813f138/content/data/versions/1070.json"}]}}, "dates": ["2026-11-26", "2026-11-25", "2026-11-24", "2026-11-23", "2026-11-22", "2026-11-21", "2026-11-20", "2026-11-19", "2026-11-18", "2026-11-